   {
    "h": "Habitat",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
     "The preferred natural habitats of Tropiocolotes nattereri are desert, rocky areas, and shrubland, at elevations up to 1,600 m (5,200 ft)."
    ]
   },
   {
    "h": "Etymology",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
